# Playwright's saved sessions. The pattern needs the `**/`: a rule with a slash
# in the middle is anchored to this file's directory, so the un-prefixed form
# matched nothing and two real JWTs were tracked in `apps/console/`.
**/test/e2e/.auth/

# Next's standalone bundle, dropped here by a Windows build whose tracing root
# resolves to `/D:/…`. Harmless output, but it is build product and was once
# committed by accident.
apps/console/ServiceLoop/

# Generated OCR eval fixtures. `pnpm eval:ocr` renders them deterministically
# from the HTML templates, and manifest.json records the template hash each
# image was built from, so committing ~5 MB of PNGs would only add drift.
packages/simulator/fixtures/ocr/
